{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00010",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.37,
      "end_seconds": 5.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "Hello, uh, doctor. It's my turn, I think."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.2,
      "end_seconds": 10.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "That's alright, take a seat. Tell me why you've come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 14.03,
      "end_seconds": 20.06,
      "duration_seconds": 6.03,
      "text": "I mean, hello, doctor, I came in with them, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.63,
      "end_seconds": 25.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Please do. Extra information is always welcome."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 27.1,
      "end_seconds": 30.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "I mean, he's been feeling lightheaded, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.8,
      "end_seconds": 36.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "And when did that start? Just so I get the full picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.06,
      "end_seconds": 43.29,
      "duration_seconds": 6.23,
      "text": "I've had it for ten days. I just want to get back to normal, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.89,
      "end_seconds": 54.3,
      "duration_seconds": 7.41,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.81,
      "end_seconds": 74.8,
      "duration_seconds": 18.99,
      "text": "Well, um, yes, hot weather and standing up. That makes it worse. It happens a few times a day. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it. I've also had nearly passing out. And blurred vision for a few seconds, too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.73,
      "end_seconds": 78.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "How much is it bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.96,
      "end_seconds": 83.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "Maybe a five out of ten on a bad day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.83,
      "end_seconds": 88.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "text": "Okay, I'm following. Have you been feeling lightheaded at any time before this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.44,
      "end_seconds": 97.59,
      "duration_seconds": 8.15,
      "text": "Yes, you know, something like this happened last year, and it went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.36,
      "end_seconds": 100.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Any slurred speech or chest pain at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.56,
      "end_seconds": 106.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Okay, so no, no slurred speech or chest pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.53,
      "end_seconds": 110.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "Have you had any weakness or palpitations?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.03,
      "end_seconds": 114.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "Oh, no weakness or palpitations, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.83,
      "end_seconds": 118.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.65,
      "end_seconds": 121.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "No, that's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.83,
      "end_seconds": 128.57,
      "duration_seconds": 5.74,
      "text": "Any medication at the moment, including things from the pharmacy? It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.63,
      "end_seconds": 133.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "Amlodipine. I take it 5 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 135.17,
      "end_seconds": 143.61,
      "duration_seconds": 8.44,
      "text": "Doctor, I think the last prescription for the amlodipine was 2.5 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.36,
      "end_seconds": 147.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Hm. Do you have the latest prescription with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.54,
      "end_seconds": 152.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "Oh, I don't think I have it with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.09,
      "end_seconds": 154.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "And alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.13,
      "end_seconds": 159.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "I have a couple of drinks on the weekend."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.66,
      "end_seconds": 161.36,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.47,
      "end_seconds": 166.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "I used to smoke but I quit five years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.04,
      "end_seconds": 173.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "Okay, what about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.82,
      "end_seconds": 178.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "I'm allergic to pollen, I get sneezing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.55,
      "end_seconds": 185.34,
      "duration_seconds": 6.79,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for? Just so I get the full picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.74,
      "end_seconds": 200.99,
      "duration_seconds": 14.25,
      "text": "High blood pressure, for about a year. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't. I took the morning off to come in today. Diabetes, for about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.11,
      "end_seconds": 211.56,
      "duration_seconds": 9.45,
      "text": "Okay, high blood pressure, that's already on your record. Good to know. Right, yes, I can see the diabetes in your file as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.95,
      "end_seconds": 215.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "One moment, the system's being slow today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.17,
      "end_seconds": 217.05,
      "duration_seconds": 0.88,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.08,
      "end_seconds": 231.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. I'll try to keep this as efficient as I can."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.62,
      "end_seconds": 234.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Thank you, I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.5,
      "end_seconds": 239.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Okay, let's do a quick examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 239.87,
      "end_seconds": 240.57,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.31,
      "end_seconds": 244.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Now I'm going to check this part."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.73,
      "end_seconds": 262.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "Your blood pressure drops when you stand, I'll note that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.03,
      "end_seconds": 265.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "Let me press here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.83,
      "end_seconds": 285.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "Heart rhythm is regular."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.14,
      "end_seconds": 302.82,
      "duration_seconds": 15.68,
      "text": "All done, thank you, please sit down. Thank you for that. I'll write up what I found in a moment, and then I'll tell you what I think is going on. Okay, did you manage to eat before coming?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.82,
      "end_seconds": 307.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "Right, yes, I had something small this morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.84,
      "end_seconds": 330.99,
      "duration_seconds": 23.15,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression is this: It fits best with postural low blood pressure. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together. It could also be dehydration, so we'll keep that open. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've been feeling lightheaded for ten days, and no chest pain or weakness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 332.35,
      "end_seconds": 334.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Yes, um, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.16,
      "end_seconds": 367.13,
      "duration_seconds": 29.97,
      "text": "I'm going to order a blood sugar test, for dizziness. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. I'd like to arrange blood tests for dizziness. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture. Get up in stages, sit on the edge of the bed for a minute first, and keep drinking water. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 368.53,
      "end_seconds": 376.08,
      "duration_seconds": 7.55,
      "text": "And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 377.44,
      "end_seconds": 378.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 379.89,
      "end_seconds": 386.92,
      "duration_seconds": 7.03,
      "text": "Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 388.48,
      "end_seconds": 390.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "Yes, I'll do that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 391.45,
      "end_seconds": 398.66,
      "duration_seconds": 7.21,
      "text": "Please come and see me in two weeks. Let me check that I've been clear. What will you do once you get home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 399.85,
      "end_seconds": 404.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "So, I come back in two weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 407.48,
      "end_seconds": 412.66,
      "duration_seconds": 5.18,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. So, we're all set. Don't leave without asking if something's unclear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 413.5,
      "end_seconds": 417.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "Nothing more from me, um, doctor, thanks."
    }
  ]
}